 * 4. Register an admin member (with elevated permissions), and as admin, delete a new member's profile (C) and confirm succeeds, cleanup as per business rules.
 * 5. Attempt to delete an already deleted or non-existent profile, expecting a suitable error (e.g., 404 Not Found or idempotent no-op with clear status).
 * 6. Confirm that deleting a profile does not affect the underlying member's data (member entity remains accessible).
