 * 3. Call the PATCH /discussionboard/boards/boardTopics endpoint with:
 *    - board filter (discussionboard_board_id)
 *    - keyword filter (on title), fuzzy matching one of the topic titles
 *    - page=1, limit=2
 *    - verify correct topics returned and metadata (pagination.pages, limit, etc)
 * 4. Check that topics returned all belong to the intended board and match the search keyword.
