 *
 * Validates the following workflow:
 * 1. Create a board announcement as admin/moderator (satisfies business privilege)
 * 2. Soft-delete the announcement (logical deletion, not physical removal)
 * 3. Assert the deleted announcement's deleted_at is set (data preserved for compliance)
 * 4. Attempt duplicate delete (already deleted) and expect error
 * 5. Attempt to delete a non-existent announcement and expect error
 *
 * Note: Role-based permission switching and unauthenticated access cases are omitted due to lack of authentication/user APIs in provided materials.
